        },
        {
          "name": "Entity Owner",
          "type": "UObject*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UInt",
      "docs": "Called by Sequencer to compute a cache key for this condition given the passed in context.\nBy default, this key will be computed based on the Binding Scope, and if relevant, the binding and entity owner.\nIf a condition returns the same cache key given the same or different contexts, it will not be rechecked, and a cached value may be used."
